# Clone entering as a copy of Wood Elemental has the copied "as this creature enters" replacement (CR 707.5), so
# Bot1 sacrifices its own untapped Forest as the Clone enters, and the copied characteristic-defining ability counts
# that sacrifice (CR 604.3): the Clone is a 1/1 Wood Elemental beside Bot2's original, which keeps its own 1/1.
